  Steps:
  - Description: "The 2 needs one more cell. <b>Drag</b> it to the right."
  - Description: "The 4 can only grow down. <b>Drag</b> it down the column."
  - Description: "The 3s need a third cell. <b>Drag</b> down into it."
  - Description: "Link the 4s: <b>drag</b> down into the empty cell."
